---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro';
---

<StarlightPage
	frontmatter={{
		title: 'Roadmap',
		description:
			'The big updates planned for eeprep: a resume builder, study guides, job board help, a LinkedIn guide, better graphics and pages on interviews.',
		head: [{ tag: 'title', content: 'Roadmap | eeprep' }],
		tableOfContents: false,
	}}
>
	<p>
		These are the big updates planned for eeprep. It's a plan, not a promise,
		and it may change.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>Resume builder.</strong> Fill in a form on the site and get a
			one-page resume, with no setup.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Study guides.</strong> Short guides to the core courses in an
			electrical engineering degree.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Job board help.</strong> Which job boards are worth your time and
			how to search them well.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>LinkedIn guide.</strong> How to set up a profile that recruiters
			find and read.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Better graphics.</strong> Clearer figures and diagrams across the
			site.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>The author's take.</strong> Notes from eeprep's author, a working
			embedded software engineer, on what worked for them.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Interviews.</strong> How engineering interviews run and how to
			prepare for them.
		</li>
	</ul>
</StarlightPage>
